1Co 7:1 , He treats of marriage;
1Co 7:4 , shewing it to be a remedy against fornication
1Co 7:10 . and that the bond thereof ought not lightly to be dissolved;
1Co 7:20 , Every man must be content with his vocation;
1Co 7:25 , Virginity wherefore to be embraced;
1Co 7:35 , and for what respects we may either marry, or abstain from marrying.
